  "releaseNotes": "xAI Grok Voice Agent adapter for Universal.Operative.Sdk.Realtime. Grok's Voice Agent API implements the OpenAI Realtime protocol nearly verbatim, so this adapter reuses Universal.OpenAI.Realtime.Client's event DTOs directly; the WebSocket connection to wss://api.x.ai/v1/realtime is hand-rolled against those same wire types. RawSendEvent is a general escape hatch, resolving any client event this adapter can send by its wire type.",
